WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Safex

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.130
Terry is in New York,

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:10.602
auditioning for a part
in "Romeo and Juliet".

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:15.340
Candy is in Chicago,

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.215
taking her nurse qualification test.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:27.426
The day we fly towards the sky.

00:00:36.303 --> 00:00:38.330
Good morning!

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.066
Hi! You look spirited today!

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:46.244
Don't let Candy pass the test.

00:00:47.014 --> 00:00:50.211
God, please don't let her pass.

00:00:50.951 --> 00:00:52.851
Please!

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:55.986
Candy!

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:59.618
Why do you want me to fail the test?

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.126
Because...

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:04.056
Be honest!

00:01:04.206 --> 00:01:06.325
You will be a qualified nurse
once you passed the test.

00:01:06.475 --> 00:01:09.099
Who will take care of us?

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.831
Don't worry.

00:01:12.981 --> 00:01:16.967
Even if I will be an official nurse,
I am still going to be Candy.

00:01:17.144 --> 00:01:20.806
Will you play with us
just like before?

00:01:20.956 --> 00:01:22.741
Sure.

00:01:22.891 --> 00:01:25.410
We shall pray again then.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:31.454
We hope Candy can pass her test, please.

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:40.292
I didn't really show it,
but actually I am a little worried.

00:01:42.636 --> 00:01:44.797
I just hope I can pass the test.

00:01:45.806 --> 00:01:47.899
How is Terry going?

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.117
The result is out.

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:06.557
Who is it?

00:02:06.927 --> 00:02:10.400
Romeo: Terrius G. Grandchester.
As expected.

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:13.327
We knew it
even before the announcement.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.235
Terry!

00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:24.167
Yes, Susanna?

00:02:25.012 --> 00:02:26.775
Why didn't you knock?

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.473
Terry, the result is out.

00:02:28.623 --> 00:02:30.576
Congratulations! I am so happy!

00:02:30.726 --> 00:02:31.977
Do I get to play Romeo?

00:02:32.127 --> 00:02:36.014
You are playing Romeo,
I am playing Juliet. That's great!

00:02:36.164 --> 00:02:38.917
If someone else would have been Romeo,
I wouldn't care about this role...

00:02:39.067 --> 00:02:41.426
Terry, wait!

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:48.126
Romeo, Terrius. G Grandchester.

00:02:48.376 --> 00:02:49.893
It's me indeed.

00:02:50.771 --> 00:02:52.705
I did it!

00:02:57.878 --> 00:02:59.505
Terrius Baker, congratulations!

00:02:59.713 --> 00:03:01.913
You are the leading man.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:06.919
Sorry? Could you repeat my name again?

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.711
My name is not Terrius Baker.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:12.659
Say that again!

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:15.153
You don't have to hide it.

00:03:15.303 --> 00:03:19.787
Everybody knows that you are
Eleanor Baker's love child.

00:03:19.937 --> 00:03:21.326
So?

00:03:21.476 --> 00:03:23.261
We envy you.

00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:26.100
Yes, you have a good mother.

00:03:28.992 --> 00:03:31.302
Wait, what has it to do with my mother?

00:03:31.812 --> 00:03:34.987
- Terry!
- What exactly are you talking about?

00:03:35.137 --> 00:03:37.010
Terry, don't be violent!

00:03:37.751 --> 00:03:41.346
Eleanor Baker was here
during the auditions.

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:42.950
What?

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:49.893
Terry.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.590
Hey...

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.704
Terry is talented.

00:03:53.854 --> 00:03:56.701
There was no lobbying.

00:03:56.937 --> 00:03:59.498
Stop being sarcastic.

00:03:59.648 --> 00:04:01.033
That's really despicable!

00:04:01.383 --> 00:04:02.931
If you guys can't accept it,

00:04:03.081 --> 00:04:05.603
why don't you try
to prove yourselves capable!

00:04:10.317 --> 00:04:12.410
You all owe Terry an apology.

00:04:12.953 --> 00:04:15.781
I never saw Susanna so angry.

00:04:15.931 --> 00:04:18.825
Yeah, she is really serious about Terry.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:28.657
Director, I have something to ask you.

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:33.233
Oh good, I was looking for you.

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:35.934
I think you saw the list.

00:04:36.084 --> 00:04:38.534
This is a major role. You can do it.

00:04:39.613 --> 00:04:42.041
I actually have some doubts.

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:44.076
Why is that?

00:04:44.226 --> 00:04:46.915
Did I win the audition on my talent?

00:04:47.254 --> 00:04:48.847
What do you mean?

00:04:48.997 --> 00:04:52.384
Is anyone behind this?

00:04:52.534 --> 00:04:54.352
Do you mean Eleanor Baker?

00:04:54.802 --> 00:04:56.361
I heard she was here
during the audition.

00:04:58.732 --> 00:05:01.257
You have underestimated me.

00:05:03.403 --> 00:05:06.348
There is no such thing
as lobbying in this business.

00:05:06.498 --> 00:05:07.999
It all depends on talent.

00:05:08.149 --> 00:05:09.801
No talent, no nothing.

00:05:09.951 --> 00:05:12.936
It's different from the outside world.

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:17.642
The crew and I picked the cast.

00:05:17.792 --> 00:05:20.719
Do you doubt yourself?

00:05:22.255 --> 00:05:25.418
I am sorry, I was just being paranoid.

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:29.688
From now on, there are going to be more
and more slandering rumours about you.

00:05:29.838 --> 00:05:33.199
We actors can't escape from that.

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:41.164
Eleanor Baker, I will challenge you!

00:05:41.314 --> 00:05:44.607
I can't change the fact that
you are my mother.

00:05:45.344 --> 00:05:48.239
But, I will overtake you.

00:05:48.389 --> 00:05:50.748
And become a great actor.

00:06:06.932 --> 00:06:09.901
Candy, I would like to invite you
to come to Broadway

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:12.396
and enjoy my performance as Romeo.

00:06:12.546 --> 00:06:15.531
This is my first step in the showbiz.

00:06:17.009 --> 00:06:20.172
Congratulations, Terry.
I am glad you did it.

00:06:20.412 --> 00:06:22.937
It must be really great for Terry
to play Romeo.

00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:25.743
Romeo and Juliet.

00:06:25.893 --> 00:06:29.380
Obstacles separated them apart.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:32.720
There is nothing between me and Terry
that baffles our love.

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:35.720
Susanna Marlowe?

00:06:36.061 --> 00:06:38.556
I trust Terry.

00:06:38.706 --> 00:06:40.792
Candy!

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.327
Candy, the results
are going to be announced!

00:06:43.477 --> 00:06:45.199
Is it time?

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:46.964
You look calm.

00:06:47.114 --> 00:06:49.266
I am so nervous!

00:06:49.416 --> 00:06:51.836
It would be a shame to fail the test.

00:06:52.186 --> 00:06:53.905
That's no big deal!

00:06:54.255 --> 00:06:55.780
You should be more relaxed.

00:07:00.319 --> 00:07:05.313
I need to pass the test
in order to take care of Mr. Albert.

00:07:07.026 --> 00:07:08.986
You are just an amateur.

00:07:09.136 --> 00:07:12.184
Violations of the hospital rules
are not allowed!

00:07:12.634 --> 00:07:14.562
Amateur?

00:07:16.135 --> 00:07:18.129
Candice! Since you insist,

00:07:18.279 --> 00:07:21.365
I hope you can pass
the nurse qualification test this month.

00:07:21.515 --> 00:07:23.267
If you become a qualified nurse,

00:07:23.417 --> 00:07:25.902
only then you can take charge
of ward No. 0.

00:07:26.378 --> 00:07:28.806
The results are ready to be published.

00:07:28.956 --> 00:07:30.974
I am so nervous!

00:07:37.556 --> 00:07:40.116
It's coming, here it comes!

00:07:56.308 --> 00:07:58.538
I did it!

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:15.953
Yes! Eleanor, you passed too!

00:08:16.729 --> 00:08:18.155
I saw my name!

00:08:18.305 --> 00:08:19.990
- Where is it?
- Right there.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.626
That's excellent, you are the third!

00:08:22.776 --> 00:08:24.100
How about you?

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:25.930
I...

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.472
Are you on the list?

00:08:28.641 --> 00:08:30.734
It's getting blurry...

00:08:32.344 --> 00:08:34.335
I can't really see...

00:08:35.247 --> 00:08:37.408
Come on, Candy!

00:08:40.452 --> 00:08:46.982
Candice White...

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.093
Yes!

00:08:50.629 --> 00:08:52.229
Look, you are the seventh!

00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:57.698
Candice White.

00:08:59.771 --> 00:09:01.365
We all passed the test.

00:09:01.515 --> 00:09:02.666
Great!

00:09:02.816 --> 00:09:05.335
Now we proved ourselves.

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:10.575
Congratulations!

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:13.711
Headmistress Mary Jane!

00:09:13.861 --> 00:09:16.080
All of you did a good job,
congratulations!

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.487
Thank you.

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:30.564
Now I will hand you
your nurse certificate.

00:09:31.203 --> 00:09:32.500
Natalie Beans.

00:09:37.843 --> 00:09:39.435
Candice White.

00:09:43.549 --> 00:09:45.342
I am a real nurse now!

00:09:45.492 --> 00:09:46.577
Candice!

00:09:48.454 --> 00:09:51.014
Can you be a real nurse?

00:09:51.323 --> 00:09:53.484
Next, Judy Muntz.

00:09:57.463 --> 00:09:58.691
Eleanor Munsey.

00:10:01.767 --> 00:10:04.463
How are you feeling?
You must be delighted.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.135
Yes!

00:10:10.642 --> 00:10:13.370
Candy, I thought you were excited
about this?

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.172
You don't look like you normally do.

00:10:15.622 --> 00:10:17.174
It's not that...

00:10:17.324 --> 00:10:21.515
Franny didn't get to sit for the test
because she went to the front line.

00:10:29.928 --> 00:10:31.488
Franny is a humble girl.

00:10:31.638 --> 00:10:34.123
She didn't write to tell you all.

00:10:36.702 --> 00:10:38.729
She sat for the test at the front line.

00:10:38.879 --> 00:10:41.637
She is already an official nurse.

00:10:41.873 --> 00:10:44.601
Yeah? That's great!

00:10:44.751 --> 00:10:49.473
All trainees from Mary Jane Nurse School
have passed the test.

00:10:49.623 --> 00:10:52.312
I feel so honoured!

00:10:54.786 --> 00:10:57.748
But the real challenge starts from now.

00:10:57.898 --> 00:11:00.724
You all have to continue to work hard
and be outstanding nurses.

00:11:01.193 --> 00:11:02.386
- Yes!
- Dismissed!

00:11:02.536 --> 00:11:04.521
Candy, you stay.

00:11:04.671 --> 00:11:05.722
Yes.

00:11:16.908 --> 00:11:19.135
Sorry, what is it about...

00:11:19.285 --> 00:11:21.304
You are a dim wit!

00:11:21.454 --> 00:11:25.708
Things about ward No. 0
have been bothering doctor Leonard.

00:11:25.858 --> 00:11:26.810
Yes.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:29.176
He complained to me about you.

00:11:29.721 --> 00:11:33.555
I wouldn't want to face any student
from your school.

00:11:35.326 --> 00:11:37.320
But, you did a good job.

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:39.455
You are the seventh in this test,

00:11:39.605 --> 00:11:43.159
and second in this school,
just right after Natalie.

00:11:43.434 --> 00:11:45.902
Pony must be happy!

00:11:46.471 --> 00:11:48.731
You should be the happiest.

00:11:48.881 --> 00:11:52.101
What doctor Leonard has promised you,

00:11:52.251 --> 00:11:53.937
I think you are determined
to do it, right?

00:11:54.187 --> 00:11:55.443
Yes.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.608
You will stay here.

00:11:58.758 --> 00:12:00.343
Natalie will go back with me.

00:12:00.493 --> 00:12:02.912
You must do everything seriously.

00:12:03.062 --> 00:12:04.284
Yes.

00:12:04.689 --> 00:12:07.917
I can look after Mr. Albert now!

00:12:08.067 --> 00:12:11.287
Caring is the best way
to bring back memories.

00:12:11.437 --> 00:12:13.829
Take good care of him.

00:12:14.432 --> 00:12:16.627
Yes. Please forgive my insistence.

00:12:17.268 --> 00:12:19.462
I will write to sister Pony.

00:12:19.612 --> 00:12:23.166
What a weak nurse!

00:12:24.175 --> 00:12:26.102
Pull yourself together!

00:12:26.252 --> 00:12:27.837
Don't take things for granted.

00:12:27.987 --> 00:12:29.004
Yes!

00:12:35.386 --> 00:12:37.146
Great!

00:12:37.296 --> 00:12:40.083
I can take care of Mr. Albert now.

00:12:40.233 --> 00:12:42.126
Mr. Albert!

00:12:44.462 --> 00:12:47.891
Mr. Albert, look!
I passed the test!

00:12:48.041 --> 00:12:49.126
Look!

00:12:52.737 --> 00:12:54.471
Congratulations, Candy.

00:12:55.173 --> 00:12:56.099
Poope!

00:12:57.976 --> 00:13:00.570
Are you happy for me as well?
Thank you!

00:13:01.379 --> 00:13:03.706
I wanted to give you a present,

00:13:03.856 --> 00:13:06.142
but I have nothing.

00:13:06.392 --> 00:13:07.677
That's alright.

00:13:07.827 --> 00:13:11.449
From now on,
I can look after Mr. Albert with care.

00:13:11.689 --> 00:13:13.983
I am contented with that.

00:13:14.433 --> 00:13:16.826
Candy, you...

00:13:33.244 --> 00:13:36.104
Let me pass! Do you smell Candy?

00:13:37.314 --> 00:13:38.679
Help!

00:13:41.719 --> 00:13:44.747
Candy is a real nurse now.

00:13:44.897 --> 00:13:48.417
Yeah, this is her picture
with her uniform.

00:13:49.059 --> 00:13:50.519
Let me see!

00:13:50.669 --> 00:13:53.893
No! Give it back! One by one!

00:13:55.533 --> 00:13:58.967
Give it back!

00:14:03.607 --> 00:14:06.633
Good morning Mr. Albert, Poope!

00:14:06.944 --> 00:14:08.976
Good morning, Candy.

00:14:15.519 --> 00:14:19.922
Stear has arranged a party for me.

00:14:20.191 --> 00:14:22.421
May I go?

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.187
You are off today.

00:14:25.337 --> 00:14:28.124
Don't worry about me, go ahead.

00:14:28.274 --> 00:14:30.793
I will be back as soon as possible.

00:14:31.202 --> 00:14:32.396
Candy!

00:14:34.405 --> 00:14:36.600
It's nothing, thank you.

00:14:37.541 --> 00:14:38.667
Good bye.

00:14:59.697 --> 00:15:01.688
Candy, we have been waiting.

00:15:02.266 --> 00:15:03.460
- Stear!
- Candy!

00:15:05.102 --> 00:15:06.662
Annie! Patty!

00:15:07.012 --> 00:15:07.965
Candy!

00:15:08.172 --> 00:15:09.631
It's been a long time.

00:15:09.781 --> 00:15:11.967
Candy, you are still full of energy!

00:15:12.117 --> 00:15:14.237
Candy, congratulations
for passing the test.

00:15:15.612 --> 00:15:17.452
Thank you, Annie.

00:15:17.902 --> 00:15:21.577
Mr. Albert will be alright
with you taking care of him.

00:15:21.727 --> 00:15:25.914
I am worried about his health,
I can't stay too long.

00:15:26.064 --> 00:15:28.822
It won't take too long. Let's go.

00:15:29.326 --> 00:15:31.019
Archie, where is Grand Aunt Elroy?

00:15:31.169 --> 00:15:32.891
She went out with Eliza.

00:15:33.096 --> 00:15:35.124
I asked Patty and Annie to come here.

00:15:35.274 --> 00:15:37.524
Candy, you happened to be off today.

00:15:38.368 --> 00:15:39.795
Candy, yesterday I...

00:15:39.945 --> 00:15:41.463
Archie!

00:15:41.613 --> 00:15:43.506
What do you mean, Archie?

00:15:44.441 --> 00:15:47.274
Nothing. Right, Archie?

00:15:48.478 --> 00:15:50.002
Candy, yesterday I...

00:15:53.417 --> 00:15:56.794
I asked everyone to come here
to give you a big present.

00:15:56.944 --> 00:15:59.481
To invite you to board the plane.

00:15:59.631 --> 00:16:02.116
Brother built it himself.

00:16:02.926 --> 00:16:04.621
I am leaving!

00:16:05.629 --> 00:16:06.653
Candy!

00:16:07.998 --> 00:16:10.192
This is a once in a lifetime chance.

00:16:10.342 --> 00:16:12.261
I am honoured, but Patty deserves it.

00:16:12.411 --> 00:16:13.860
Patty, the chance is yours.

00:16:14.771 --> 00:16:17.599
He said I was too heavy.

00:16:18.049 --> 00:16:20.909
We gave it up, right, Annie?

00:16:22.312 --> 00:16:23.572
How come?

00:16:23.722 --> 00:16:24.940
Candy, let's go.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:26.241
But Stear...

00:16:26.391 --> 00:16:29.649
An airplane is different from a car,
it's too dangerous!

00:16:33.256 --> 00:16:36.282
Look, the king of the sky!

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:38.854
How is it? You must love it.

00:16:39.004 --> 00:16:41.124
The name sounds alright.

00:16:42.866 --> 00:16:44.527
It's going to crash...

00:16:49.739 --> 00:16:51.798
Come, get dressed.

00:16:53.843 --> 00:16:56.243
And the pants.

00:16:58.515 --> 00:17:00.415
All done.

00:17:01.418 --> 00:17:03.818
Turn around.

00:17:05.922 --> 00:17:07.981
Looks alright.

00:17:09.526 --> 00:17:11.153
Stear...

00:17:11.503 --> 00:17:13.862
Get on the plane,
we are ready for takeoff.

00:17:15.365 --> 00:17:16.725
Is it alright?

00:17:16.875 --> 00:17:19.361
I don't know, it's brother's invention.

00:17:19.511 --> 00:17:20.801
Stear!

00:17:24.274 --> 00:17:26.071
Sit tight, we are moving.

00:17:28.678 --> 00:17:31.112
See you later, let's go.

00:17:31.448 --> 00:17:33.712
The king of the sky! Go!

00:17:45.996 --> 00:17:48.590
Candy, hold on to the parachute!

00:17:49.165 --> 00:17:51.292
It's alright, Candy.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.137
A tree!

00:17:56.072 --> 00:17:57.562
Not good!

00:18:04.714 --> 00:18:06.238
They will hit it!

00:18:12.589 --> 00:18:14.181
They are through.

00:18:24.991 --> 00:18:27.568
Candy! Open your eyes!

00:18:28.605 --> 00:18:30.197
- We are flying!
- Of course.

00:18:31.908 --> 00:18:36.436
That's The Adley residence,
how magnificent!

00:18:37.013 --> 00:18:38.380
So beautiful!

00:18:41.017 --> 00:18:44.045
This is cool, they are flying.

00:18:44.195 --> 00:18:45.287
Yeah.

00:18:48.925 --> 00:18:50.256
It's nothing.

00:18:50.526 --> 00:18:54.322
Stear, let’s get lower ok?
They are just down there.

00:18:54.472 --> 00:18:56.424
Sure, but it's good, no?

00:18:56.574 --> 00:18:59.696
It doesn't feel so good
when I think about war.

00:19:06.442 --> 00:19:08.307
Candy!

00:19:18.955 --> 00:19:20.923
Help!

00:19:24.627 --> 00:19:26.220
Get off!

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:27.785
Jump!

00:19:35.371 --> 00:19:37.532
I knew it...

00:19:37.682 --> 00:19:38.665
Candy!

00:19:39.542 --> 00:19:41.772
In the end, it's brother's invention.

00:19:46.115 --> 00:19:47.909
Candy, brother, are you alright?

00:19:48.059 --> 00:19:49.474
- Candy!
- Stear!

00:19:51.721 --> 00:19:53.114
Candy, that was funny, right?

00:19:53.264 --> 00:19:56.215
That was the first successful test-fly.

00:19:56.559 --> 00:19:57.890
The first time?!

00:19:58.327 --> 00:20:00.762
Yeah, the first time
I've taken someone on.

00:20:02.031 --> 00:20:03.830
- Stear!
- Candy...

00:20:04.033 --> 00:20:05.493
Stear has put in a lot of effort.

00:20:05.643 --> 00:20:09.631
Candy, don't you think
this parachute looks strange?

00:20:09.781 --> 00:20:10.832
Yes.

00:20:10.982 --> 00:20:13.534
Candy jumped off with the parachute

00:20:13.684 --> 00:20:15.099
in such a cool way!

00:20:26.322 --> 00:20:29.723
I am so happy
to receive so many presents.

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.420
I want to tell Mr. Albert about it.

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:34.690
Maybe that will cheer him up.

00:20:44.507 --> 00:20:46.304
Mr. Albert!

00:20:46.743 --> 00:20:48.443
Mr. Albert, I am back!

00:20:52.415 --> 00:20:56.351
Mr. Albert is not here.
Where did he go?

00:21:05.661 --> 00:21:08.656
Thank you, Candy.
I will never forget you.

00:21:08.806 --> 00:21:10.691
Albert with no name.

00:21:10.841 --> 00:21:12.528
Mr. Albert!

00:21:13.536 --> 00:21:19.166
Mr. Albert lost his memory
due to injury.

00:21:19.316 --> 00:21:22.039
Where exactly did he go?

00:21:22.378 --> 00:21:26.747
Candy's heart is filled
with a sudden emptiness.
